# Hyphenation (reference/common/typography.md): page of 200 × 200 with margins of 20, page area of 160 × 160 from
# (20, 20). Lines of 12 (Size 10); with the test metrics each character measures 5 pt, the hyphen too. Language es:
# the Spanish patterns give pro-gra-ma-ción and ex-tra-or-di-na-ria.
#   greedy:   Hyphenate: true in a box of 70 (14 characters). "la programación" is 15 and does not fit; the longest part
#             of programación that fits with its hyphen is "programa-": "la programa-" (12). The rest, "ción", starts
#             the next line, where "extraordinaria" (14) does not fit after it; its longest fitting part is "extraor-":
#             "ción extraor-" (13). Then "dinaria" (7). Three lines: 36. y = 20.
#   balanced: the same text with Line breaking: balanced. The text has 30 characters with its spaces: two lines of 14
#             cannot hold it (at most 29 with the space between them), so it has three lines whatever the breaks: 36.
#             y = 56.
#   soft:     "ultra<SHY>moderno ultra<SHY>modernos", where <SHY> is a soft hyphen (U+00AD, invisible in this file),
#             without Hyphenate, in a box of 60 (12 characters). The soft hyphen is not measured: "ultramoderno" is 12
#             and fills the first line. "ultramodernos" (13) does not fit, and the soft hyphen is the only place where
#             it may split: "ultra-" (6) and "modernos" (8). Three lines: 36. y = 92.
#   row:      a Stack whose item takes its natural width: "ul<SHY>tra" measures its five letters, 25, because the soft
#             hyphen is not painted where the word is not split. x = 20, y = 128, 12 high.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 200
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Text: la programación extraordinaria
			Id: greedy
			Box:
				Width: 70
			Typography:
				Hyphenate: true
		Text: la programación extraordinaria
			Id: balanced
			Box:
				Width: 70
			Typography:
				Hyphenate: true
				Line breaking: balanced
		Text:
			Id: soft
			Box:
				Width: 60
			Content >>
				ultra­moderno ultra­modernos
		Stack:
			Id: row
			Item:
				Text: ul­tra
					Id: unsplit
